  Q3.Proofs.penaltyForm_lower_bound_of_midpoint_lower_bound_and_radius_floor
    M Q controlK9TauD controlK9DIntervalFloor controlK9DPenaltyRadiusFloor
    (Q3.Proofs.penaltyMatrix controlK9D controlK9Q controlK9TauD)
